#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "Online Training is a modern WordPress block theme designed for fitness coaches, personal trainers, gyms, and online course creators. It ships with purpose-built block patterns for course listings, curriculum breakdowns, coach and instructor profiles, student reviews, pricing, training blogs, and more — making it easy to launch a professional coaching and course platform without writing code. Fully compatible with Masteriyo LMS for course management, lessons, quizzes, student profiles, and enrollment."
msgstr ""

